Z||000001||Monkeyman||07-10-2000||11:36 AM||||Are there specific roof pieces (skin, not metal) for the T-top equipped cars or do you just have to cut up what you currently have?<P>------------------<BR>Dave-<BR>Grape Ape ('85GT)||||reg||1
Z||000002||mrfixit58||07-10-2000||01:11 PM||||Are you taking pictures? Someone on the forum is requesting "how-to" articles. I would love to see pictures along with a write-up. <P>I bought a complete T-top off of a car is the junk yard and have thought many times about installing it. As a matter of fact, TOM is working on new plastic corner pieces and overhead console replacements.<P>Keep us posted on your progress.<P>Roy||||reg||14
